            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Going Around 0.3.37

- Airborne is now called **Going Around**. Your settings, saved place and data carry over, and updates keep arriving as before.
- The app's file in your Applications folder keeps its old name, Airborne.app. You can rename it to "Going Around.app" while the app is quit if you like; don't drag in a second copy.
- "Combined signals" and "Local estimate" replace labels that used the app's old name.
]]></description>
